AION Embedded Linux - meta-local
================================

This Yocto layer contains the custom recipes and configuration
for AION Embedded Linux on Raspberry Pi 3 (64-bit).

Project:
  AI-Now Yocto Raspberry Pi 3

Target:
  Raspberry Pi 3 Model B
  ARM64 (aarch64)

Yocto:
  Scarthgap (5.0 LTS)

Features:
  - Linux console with UTF-8 and CJK support
  - kmscon terminal on tty1
  - Traditional getty recovery console on tty2
  - NetworkManager with Wi-Fi support
  - OpenSSH remote access
  - Avahi / mDNS discovery
  - Raspberry Pi wireless firmware
  - systemd service integration

Custom image recipes:
  core-image-base-cjk.bb
  core-image-aion.bb

Dependencies:
  poky
  meta-openembedded
  meta-raspberrypi

Build target:
  bitbake core-image-aion

This repository excludes music collections, local build caches,
generated SD card images and upstream Yocto source trees.

